    "creative": "The $179 for 20 units tox offer works in both Bellatox markets: 'Attention Louisville and surrounding areas,' 15 chairs held for new clients, brought 18 leads in KY and 21 in IN. Desert Zen's text image, 'The T-Shape 2 has arrived at Desert Zen,' first session $149 instead of $399, brought 28 leads at $9.47 each. Sanctuaire's video, 'accepting 15 tox and filler models this month,' brought 21. Worth testing the '15 chairs' opening at Dr Chase, whose tox offer brought 4 leads at $42.17 each.",
    "doing": "The spas brought 155 leads into their CRMs this week at $25.17 each, up from 142 at $28.10 the week before, on about the same spend. Bellatox KY led with 43 leads at $11.31 each, and Desert Zen brought 30 at the same cost.",
    "look_into": "Meta counted 239 leads but 155 reached the CRMs; Sanctuaire's 54 cannot be checked until its CRM is connected. The widest gaps are Essential Health (18 against 8) and Bellatox IN (39 against 30). C Your Beauty's ad account had a declined payment Oct 7 and brought 3 leads.",
    "next": "We recommend checking how leads pass from the form to the CRM at Essential Health, where 8 of Meta's 18 leads arrived, before adding budget there. Its cost per CRM lead is $52.74, against $25.17 for the group."
